WEBVTT

00:07:28.898 --> 00:07:34.000
It was described in a gambling father 
who had lost his life's savings

00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:37.152
with a roll of the dice,

00:07:37.152 --> 00:07:41.823
in a bride who'd
been left at the alter.

00:07:41.823 --> 00:07:46.464
But it turns out, this 
"new" human diagnosis

00:07:46.464 --> 00:07:50.939
was neither new, nor
was it uniquely human.

00:07:50.939 --> 00:07:56.867
Veterinarians had been diagnosing, 
treating and even preventing

00:07:56.867 --> 00:08:00.746
emotionally induced
symptoms in animals